---
const nodes = [
  { t: 'Poste', s: 'Windows · macOS · Linux' },
  { t: 'Réseau', s: 'Box, VLAN, VPN, wifi' },
  { t: 'Serveur', s: 'VPS Linux, services' },
  { t: 'Site', s: 'Code, base, déploiement' },
];
---
<figure class="chain">
  <div class="ch-row above">
    <span class="ch-brk">Prestataire A</span>
    <span class="ch-brk">Prestataire B</span>
    <span class="ch-brk">Prestataire C</span>
  </div>

  <ol class="ch-nodes">
    {nodes.map((n, i) => (
      <li class="ch-n">
        <span class="ch-i mono">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
        <span class="ch-t">{n.t}</span>
        <span class="ch-s">{n.s}</span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ol>

  <div class="ch-under">
    <span class="ch-uline" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <span class="ch-ulabel">Un seul interlocuteur</span>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    Quatre étages, une seule personne qui les traverse. La cause se trouve au lieu
    d'être renvoyée au voisin.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .chain { margin: 0; }
  .ch-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
  .ch-brk {
    font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.67rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint); text-align: center; padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
    border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--rule-strong);
  }
  .ch-nodes { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
  .ch-n {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.15rem;
    padding: 1.15rem 0.9rem; border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-right: 0;
    background: var(--paper-warm);
  }
  .ch-n:last-child { border-right: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .ch-i { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.68rem; }
  .ch-t { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .ch-s { font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.4; }

  .ch-under { position: relative; margin-top: 0.6rem; text-align: center; }
  .ch-uline { display: block; height: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--accent); border-top: 0; }
  .ch-ulabel {
    display: inline-block; margin-top: 0.55rem; font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600;
  }
  figcaption { margin-top: 1.1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--ink-soft); max-width: 54ch; }

  @media (max-width: 46rem) {
    .ch-nodes { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    .ch-n { border-right: 1px solid var(--rule); border-bottom: 0; }
    .ch-n:nth-child(-n+2) { border-bottom: 0; }
    .ch-n:nth-child(n+3) { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
    .ch-row { display: none; }
  }
</style>
